(439, 23, '', '2009-02-02', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, fragment', 'BE09-54/012/004', 'gg', 'gg-001', '', '1', '2.9x1 cm; dia.c.5.8 cm', 'sherd', 'edge of shoulder; single groove around outside circumference, angular profile\nItalic?', 'clay', 'fabric 2,5YR4/8 red, fine\nslip 10YR4/6 red', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:08'),
(440, 51, '', '2009-01-29', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, fragment', 'BE09-55/003/007', 'gg', 'gg-002', '', '1', '5.7 x 3.5; H.1.8;\nDia.rim c. 6; base c. 4; Th.walls 0.7', 'base fragment', 'Rounded wall, beginning of nozzle, on the inside surface traces of the forming of the nozzle.', 'clay', 'fabric 7.5YR5/6 reddish yellow;\nslip 10YR6/4 light yellowish brown;\ncoarse, porous, temper', '', 'Frog?', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:34'),
(441, 47, '', '2009-01-28', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, fragment', 'BE09-55/005/002', 'gg', 'gg-003', '', '1', '2 x 2; H. 2.7; Th.wall 0.25-0.3', 'nozzle, worn surface', 'Nozzle, heart-shaped, modeled outline, small wick hole, blackened tip. Relief band between double ring, leaving a narrow shoulder. Continuous rosette(?) on wide shallow discus.', 'clay', 'fabric 2,5YR5/6 red, fine, weakly micaceous;5/8 red, inside body and nozzle also\nslip 10R', '1st - mid 2nd century AD, possible mid 2nd+ century AD', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:25'),
(442, 47, '', '2009-01-28', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, fragment', 'BE09-55/005/003', 'gg', 'gg-004', '', '1', '6.2 x 1.4; H. 2.3; Th.wall 0.2-0.38;\nDia. c. 6.5.', 'shoulder edge', 'Shoulder passing straight into nozzle, angular joining to body, thick joining seam inside, outside seam uneven. Molded criss-cross pattern following rounded outline of shoulder, ending irregularly toward the nozzle. Fingerprint inside. Traces of slip on the molded decoration and next to nozzle inside; otherwise darker inside bottom, more yellow on top, staining.', 'clay', 'fabric 5YR4/6 yellowish-red to 2,5YR4/6 red; outside 2,5YR5/6 red; inside 2,5YR6/5 reddish-yellow, ground under slip;\nslip 10R5/8 red;\nclay fine, but porous, break not homogeneous in color', '1st - mid 2nd century AD, possible mid 2nd+ century AD', 'Frog', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:25'),
(443, 47, '', '2009-01-28', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp discus', 'BE09-55/005/004', 'gg', 'gg-005', '', '1', 'Dia. 6; L.+6.1;\nH.+1.1;\nTh.wall c.0.2; dia. discus c.3.6; dia filling hole 0.45;', 'two matching fragments, surface worn', 'Round, molded lamp. Deep discus, small filling hole off center; relief rosette, 24 petals, lightly impressed. Double ring around discus with rounded ridge in between, set of wide and narrow ridge between three rings centrally on flat shoulder; steep angularly joining body wall, beveled edge. Nozzle could have been heart-shaped. Slip runs down in the petal ends and gathers in grooves.\nCoarse fabric, execution mediocre.', 'clay', 'fabric 2,5YR6/6 light red; ground under slip also inside 10YR8/2 very pale brown; clay fine, slightly porous, lip splotchy with depressions, smeared across inside', '1st - mid 2nd century AD, possible mid 2nd+ century AD', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:24'),
(444, 56, '', '2009-01-31', 2009, 1, '', '', 'terracotta', 'BE09-55/007/003', 'T', '', 'frg', '1', '', '', '', 'clay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2011-01-11 23:00:00'),
(445, 59, '', '2009-02-02', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, fragment', 'BE09-55/010/001', 'gg', 'gg-007', '', '1', '2.8 x 2.2; H. 2+;', 'sherd', 'steep rounded shoulder with big relief dot. Edge is strangely smooth', 'clay', 'fabric 5YR5/6 yellowish-red', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:23'),
(446, 60, '', '2009-02-02', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp? terracotta?', 'BE09-55/011/001', 'gg/T', 'gg-008', '', '1', '4 x 2.5; H.1.2+; Th.>1;', 'fragment', 'Rounded fragment, possibly from a small discus. Inner curve has depression as if toward discus or inside elbow(?), outer edge shows seam, like in lamp. Thick and coarsely made.', 'clay', 'fabric 5YR4/4 reddish brown; cluster of black dots on surface; porous clay, yellowish streak in break; fingerprint inside pushing out mold.', 'mid 1st - mid 2nd century AD', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2024-06-16 10:24:58'),
(447, 63, '', '2009-02-03', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp lug(?)', 'BE09-55/013/004', 'gg', 'gg-009', '', '1', '2.8+ x 2.3+\nH. 3.2+', 'fragment', 'Conical lug(?) attached to very thick wall, faceted shape.', 'clay', 'fabric 2.5YR.4/6 red; 10YR.5/6 red\nCoarse, gritty, porous, cracks.', '1st century AD (second half)', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:22'),
(448, 79, '', '2009-02-05', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, shoulder-to-discus', 'BE09-55/029/002', 'gg', 'gg-010', 'frg', '1', '4.5+ x 2.2;\nH. 0.8+\nDia. c. 7 cm\nTh. wall 0.2-0.4', 'fragment. Slip worn on projecting surfaces, collected in hollows (technological).', 'Mouldmade lamp. Ridged shoulder: flat-topped ridge between deep concentric grooves. Discus framed with rounded ring set off from discus with shallow groove collecting slip. Deep discus with steep side descending to flat center. Shallow impressed radiate pattern on sloping part of discus (at least 27 rays on this fragment, 0.6 long). Flat discus set off by low faint relief ridge around the circumference . Single stained concentric ring with center dot (ovolus?) on sloping shoulder surface (stain?). Shoulder sloping toward maximum diameter of body.', 'clay', 'fabric 7,5YR.6/6 reddish-yellow\nslip 5&R.5/6 yellowidh red to 5YR.4/1 dark gray, uneven; dripping streaks on inside surface', '1st (late) - early 2nd century AD?', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 15:17:27'),
(449, 81, '', '2009-02-07', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, base', 'BE09-55/029/004', 'gg', 'gg-011', 'frg', '1', 'L. 8; W. 6.7;\nH. 1.9;\nDia. base 3.3', 'Bottom part of mold. Salt-encrusted.', 'Round moldmade lamp, bottom half.\nRing base, set off by impressed groove, bottom slightly concave. Round body, sagging side walls. Short, thick nozzle, low wide underside running even with the bottom surface, tip flattened in outline. Finger-pressing of nozzle into mold, leaving technological marks. Crooked overall shape.', 'clay', 'fabric (missing from notes): coarse, porous.\ninside color ruddy red, ruddy red-brown\noutside red-brown', '1st (late) - early 2nd century AD', 'FROG', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2015-02-22 21:51:54'),
(450, 85, '', '2009-02-09', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, shoulder-to-discus', 'BE09-55/033/004', 'gg', 'gg-012', '', '1', '4.3+ x 2.5+ x 1.1+\nTh. 0.45-0.7;\ndia. discus c. 3.3', 'fragment, worn - long lier.', 'Moldmade round lamp.\nPeaking ridge at top of shoulder, gently descending to small deep discus with large central filling hole. Impressed groove emphasizing ridge externally. Shoulder sloping down from the groove. Attached big flat knob on shoulder (applique). Inside surface coarsely smoothed in mold, doubled with clay, flat under the thickened shoulder ridge all the way to the side wall seam break.', 'clay', 'fabric 5YR.6/6 reddish yellow, porous, gritty', '2nd century AD (mid-late), poorly dated', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:19'),
(451, 88, '', '2009-01-28', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, shoulder', 'BE09-57/001/007c', 'gg', 'gg-013', '', '3', 'c) 2.3+ x 1.7+\nH. 1.1\nTh. wall 0.8(discus), 0.6 (wall)', 'fragment, worn slip, collected in groves and preserved on side wall', 'Flat ridged shoulder. Rectangular external ridge, two narrower rectangular ridges and wider inner one, separated by deep grooves. Inner edge of shoulder at junction with discus marked by double concentric ring separated by groove. On discus impressed lanceolate leaf(?) outlined in relief, at avery sharp angle in relation to the circumference. (wreath?, branch?).', 'clay', 'fabric 10YR.7/3 and 7/4 very pale brown, slip 10YR.3/1 very dark gray\nfine, porous, including big elongated pores', '', '', '', 'Three fragments probably belonging to a single lamp', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:18'),
(452, 94, '', '2009-01-31', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, base-to-body-to-nozzle', 'BE09-57/001/273', 'gg', 'gg-014', '', '1', '4.3+ x 3.4+\nH.2.1+\nTh. wall 0.5\nDia. base 3.2', 'fragment', 'Round moldmade lamp.\nRound base with wide ring groove. Deeply articulated, fleshy volute. The articulation tooled in the wet clay by paring away clay. Sagging body wall. Floor thick, clay added on the inside, also on the inside of the nozzle.', 'clay', 'fabric 2.5YR.3/3 dark reddish brown\nfine, porous', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:18');
INSERT INTO `find` (`id`, `bucket_id`, `trench`, `date`, `year`, `month`, `date_remarks`, `sca_register`, `object`, `object_no`, `category`, `category_no`, `weight`, `quantity`, `dimensions`, `preservation`, `description`, `material`, `material_remarks`, `dating_absolute`, `typology_reference`, `publications`, `remarks`, `rebuild_changes`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(453, 94, '', '2009-01-31', 2009, 1, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, base-to-body-to-nozzle', 'BE09-57/001/274', 'gg', 'gg-015', 'frg', '1', '4.5+ x 4.9+\nH. 2.2\nTh. 0.6-0.8, wall 0.5 Base c. 5\nGroove 0.2 cm deep', 'fragment', 'Moldmade round lamp. Big.\nImpressed groove around base, deep rounded section. Sagging body wall. Sharply delineated passage to nozzle(?). Base thinner in center, raised above the impressed groove (technological).', 'clay', 'fabric 2.5YR.4/4 reddish brown, 4/6 red\noutside bottom 2.5YR.2,5/3 dark reddish brown\nfine, porous clay, uneven break color (brick kind), smooth surface', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:17'),
(454, 104, '', '2009-02-04', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, discus', 'BE09-57/007/021', 'gg', 'gg-016', '', '1', '2.1+ x 1.3+\nTh. 0.3', 'fragment', 'Moldmade lamp.\nRelief concentric ridges, rounded, on flat shoulder. Edge of discus rounded, emphasized by impressed ridge around it. Decoration in the form of a double-lobed petal with bisected tip outline. Fragments of neighboring petals(?). Thin, smooth walls.', 'clay', 'fabric 2.5YR.5/6 red ?\nslip worn.', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:17'),
(455, 105, '', '2009-02-04', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, discus-to-shoulder', 'BE09-57/008/004b', 'gg', 'gg-017', '', '2', '3 x 1.8\nH. 1.7', 'fragment', 'Frog-type rows of globules(?), very worn. Visible fragment of sealing seam.', 'clay', 'fabric 7.5YR.4/4 brown\nslip 10R.3/4 dusty red(?)', '', 'Frog(?)', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:15'),
(456, 105, '', '2009-02-04', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, discus-to-nozzle', 'BE09-57/008/005', 'gg', 'gg-018', '', '1', '3.5+ x 3.9+\nH. 1.3+\nTh. 0.4', 'fragment', 'Small discus with trace of filling hole (clay leftover from piercing discus). Relief rings around discus, discontinuous(?). Relief blob on top of nozzle ridge with distinct relief ring to the right, faint, possibly double ring on the left. Dstinct relief line (ring?) arching between this decoration/lamp body and nozzle. Suspended from the line five bars forming palmette pattern, longest in the center and symmetrically on either side two shorter ones, terminating in a thickening or flopping tip. At broken nozzle end of fragment, traces of blackening (wick hole?).', 'clay', 'fabric 7.5YR.3/2 dark brown (top), 4/4 brown (inside)\nfine, minute pores', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:15'),
(457, 106, '', '2009-02-05', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, shoulder', 'BE09-57/008/020', 'gg', 'gg-019', '', '2', '1.6+ x 1.9+\nTh. wall 0.5', 'fragments', 'Top of shoulder. Deeply grooved decoration in relief. Vertical relief bar bordered by double relief cable pattern, perhaps beginning of third bar. Plain at the bottom, edging to seam with lower part of lamp.', 'clay', 'fabric 2.5YR.4/6 red\nblack core in break', '', 'Frog(?)', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:14'),
(458, 115, '', '2009-02-01', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, top', 'BE09-999/006', 'gg', 'gg-020', '', '1', 'L. 9.2; W. 7.2\nH. 2.8+', 'Cracked top of lamp; top of lug broken. Blackened inside. Clay peeling and flaking.', 'Almond-shaped lamp, molded.\nRaised rounded ridge around small sunken discus with big uneven filling hole off center. Raised ridge around big nozzle hole, pierced with thick round tool at an angle toward the center, leaving extra clay. Lug handle one with the body, pinched and pulled up.', 'clay', 'fabric 7.5YR.5/4 brown\ndark gray in break, burnt through', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 14:59:13'),
(459, 119, 'Sarapis Temple', '2009-02-09', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, base-to-shoulder, nozzle', 'BE09-999/011', 'gg', 'gg-021', '', '1', 'L. 7.2+; W. 5.5+;\nH. 3.2\nTh. 0.5-0.6', 'fragment preserving whole body profile crosswise. Burnt. Covered thickly with a greasy dark deposit.', 'Moldmade lamp.\nTrapezoid body, deep. Fleshy relief ridge around probably very small and deep discus. Narrow flat shoulder with sunken relief ornament consisting of almond-shaped/teardrop dots, 0.6 cm in diameter , tips pointing outward, separated by double (nearer nozzle) or triple globules. The band with the decoration is sandwiched between fleshy ridges, the outer ridge passing into steep side wall, meeting lower body walls at mid height with strong carination at the seam (inside excess clay at seam). Nozzle broken on top, bottom long and gently shaped. Base flat, concave enough to show relief design on the bottom: relief ring with perpendicularly crossing spokes aligned with the long and short axes. Projecting base surfaces worn.', 'clay', 'fabric 5YR.5/4 reddish brown,\n5YR.3/1 very dark gray to black surface, underneath fine glossy red 2.5YR.4/6\nclay fine, gray streak in break', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2015-02-21 11:41:14'),
(460, 121, '', '2009-02-11', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, discus-to-shoulder', 'BE09-999/013', 'gg', 'gg-022', '', '1', 'L. 6+; W. 3+;\nH. 1+;\nDia. filling hole 0.7', 'half of discus with shoulder, chipped and worn.', 'Round moldmade lamp.\nSmall medium-size discus with ridge around it. Plain, filling hole in center with excess clay from piercing. Band of ornament sandwiched between ridges, the outer one passing to falling steeply sides. Ornament in shallow sunk relief, taking on form of continuous S-shaped spirals. Possible double ridge toward nozzle, where thin wall. Shoulder thickened under ornament.', 'clay', 'fabric 5YR.5/6 yellowish red (surface), 7.5YR.5/1 gray (streaked break), possible dark gray on top of ornament; fine clay, porous, dark and white grits medium-to-small.', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2015-02-21 11:38:31'),
(461, 121, '', '2009-02-11', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, discus-to-handle', 'BE09-999/014', 'gg', 'gg-023', '', '1', 'L. 7.9+; W: 5.5+;\nH. 2.3\nDia. filling hole 0.9', 'top without nozzle. Blackened with smoke and use.', 'Moldmade lamp. Oval discus, open to nozzle. Relief ring around central filling hole, leaving a narrow plain space around it. Ornament on bulging rounded band sandwiched between two relief ridges, the outer one poorly impressed, surrounding the shoulder decoration. distinct on the handle side. From this ridge steeply sloping plain side wall. Ridge opening to wide nozzle. Ornament on shoulder band consisting of four concentric rows of more or less regular small globules. Same relief globules in transverse rows on nozzle top at junction between discus and nozzle, suspended as an upside triangle (that is, broadening toward the nozzle). Pinched pulled out handle, not pierced. Inside surface smooth.', 'clay', 'fabric 2,5YR.4/6 red\nclay coarse, medium porous, grits, specks of mica, white and black particles', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 15:18:15'),
(462, 121, '', '2009-02-11', 2009, 2, '', 'study - site-BE09', 'lamp, discus-to-nozzle', 'BE09-999/015', 'gg', 'gg-024', '', '1', 'L. 7.2+; W. 5.1+;\nTh. i.5;\nDia. filling hole 0.7; wick hole c. 1', 'top, broken off nozzle end and part of side. Blackened to dark gray on top. Worn.', 'Round moldmade lamp.\nSmall round discus surrounded by high relief ridge. Regular big filling hole in center. Second relief ridge surrounding first, terminating at the nozzle. Channel down the middle of the nozzle lined with relief lines terminating in scrolls on the shoulder where nozzle attached to body. Between the parallel volute lines , transverse relief bars (3?) ending in a round blob suspended from discus ridge. At opposite side, faint relief V-shaped ridge paralleled at sides by arching lines - schematic frog legs. On sides of shoulders four rows of faint globules. No handle', 'clay', 'fabric 7.5YR.5/4 brown\nfine clay', '', 'FROG', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2014-02-06 15:18:17'),
(463, 116, '', '2009-02-04', 2009, 2, '', '', 'Latin, inscribed', 'BE09-999/009', 'u', 'G074', '', '1', '', '', 'imported ? amphora with inscription TES', 'pottery', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2011-01-11 23:00:00'),
(464, 59, '', '2009-02-02', 2009, 2, '', '', 'graffito, scratched', 'BE09-55/010/002', 'u', 'G075', '', '1', '', '', 'scratched post-firing', 'pottery', 'Egyptian marl', '', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2015-12-13 21:17:54'),
(465, 47, '', '2009-01-28', 2009, 1, '', '', 'graffito, scratched', 'BE09-55/005/007', 'u', 'G076', '1', '1', '', '', 'letters AP (Greek), Egyptian amphora', 'pottery', 'scratched post-firing', '1st - mid 2nd century AD, possible mid 2nd+ century AD', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2015-12-13 21:32:23'),
(466, 50, '', '2009-01-29', 2009, 1, '', '', 'graffito, scratched , South Arabian', 'BE09-55/006/005', 'u', 'G035', '1', '1', '', '', '\"spider\" mark', 'pottery', '', 'Early Roman, poorly dated', '', '', '', '', '2011-01-01 00:01:01', '2015-12-13 21:34:35'),
