(19206, 2095, '', '2014-12-20', 2014, 12, '', 'SCA 1571', 'intaglio', 'BE15-999/08', 'rr', '', 'tbc', '1', 'L.0.75;W.0.63;Th.0.2', 'complete', 'oval form. Flat back, raised top with gently rounded edges. Sunken relief. Upper body of winged cupid at left edge, looking in. Figure milking a goat from the back, animal standing to right.', 'stone?', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2015-02-08 06:50:24', '2017-10-01 13:34:05'),
(19208, 2513, '', '2015-01-18', 2015, 1, '', 'SCA 1573', 'intaglio', 'BE15-102/039/001', 'rr', '', '3', '1 pc', 'L.2.54;W.1.87;Th.0.42', 'complete', 'Oval gemstone, flat back, recessed (W.1.7) for mounting; top convex. Some abrasion/chipping at edges. Sunken relief. Standing robed female figure with right hand outstretched in offering gesture, left hand holding attribute in foreshortening. Right hand shown as three cuts, unjoined (attribute or poor carving or non-human?). Head without details on long neck. Magical?', 'stone?glass?', '', 'Early Roman (1st century AD?)', '', '', '', '', '2015-02-08 07:30:46', '2017-10-01 13:34:07'),
(19209, 2367, '', '2015-01-14', 2015, 1, '', 'SCA 1574', 'lion protome', 'BE15-111/009/001', 'Dc', '', '35', '1', 'L.7.8;W.3.8;Th.1.3;hole0.4x0.5', 'Fragment', 'Left side of lion head with mane. Bulging parts above right eye of animal, double lock above it inclined to outside; semicicrcular locks above in two rows, terminating at ear which starts from a double curescent uoturned. Below ear two rows of locks descending in semicircle below face. Hole (irregular)just below mounting of ear. Relief (meaning the cast metal sheet was about 0.4 cm thick)', 'metal', 'copper alloy, cast?', 'Roman', '', '', 'Conserved (M.Hense, 2015)', '', '2015-02-08 07:39:19', '2018-02-24 17:37:11'),
(19210, 2628, '', '2015-02-22', 2015, 2, '', 'SCA 1575', 'lamp, FROG', 'BE15-110/017/003', 'gg', '', '53', '1 pc', 'L.6.8; W.5.6;H.3.3', 'complete', 'Round lamp with angular front shoulder.Short angular nozzle. Back legs and front legs at the side. Bead ridge around discus hole, Flat base.', 'clay', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2015-02-08 07:51:08', '2015-02-21 12:46:42'),
(19211, 2551, '', '2015-01-26', 2015, 1, '', 'SCA 1576', 'bowl, inturned', 'BE15-104/045/003', 'G', 'G1092', '310', '1 pc', 'Dia.max.14.8;H.7.5', 'complete', 'bowl, inturned rim', 'clay', 'reduced silt fabric', 'Ptolemaic', '', '', '', '', '2015-02-08 08:11:03', '2015-02-08 19:00:51'),
(19212, 2560, '', '2015-01-26', 2015, 1, '', 'SCA 1577', 'cooking pot', 'BE15-104/030/001', 'G', 'G1109', '846', '1 pc', 'Dia.rim12.5;body max.20.5;H.16.6', 'complete', 'cooking pot, biconical shape, straight slightly flaring rim, two strap handles from top rim to top body. Burnt bottom, outside and inside. Possibly discarded when burned with food inside.', 'clay', 'silt', 'Ptolemaic', '', '', '', '', '2015-02-08 08:17:40', '2015-02-08 19:01:04'),
(19213, 2444, '', '2015-01-19', 2015, 1, '', 'SCA 1578', 'stele, carved', 'BE15-111/011/002', 'rr', 'BIT', '10 000', '1', 'L.35+;W.29;Th.7', 'fragment', 'top part, arched top, carved decoration in low bas relief, top register in arch, winged double uraes with solar disk. Lower register, Osirirs Minat right extreme receiving small naked pharaoh figure on table on legs of joined Nile lotus buds?, holding stick to mouth, carrying something, behind him procession of god and goddess, Ptah and Hathor with ankh signs in right hand, staff in left hand (he) and raised hand (she). On ground line, below register division and another scene, only head of double crown visible at right extreme edge.', 'stone', 'anhydrite, coarse-grained', 'Roman', '', '', '', '', '2015-02-08 11:04:08', '2018-02-01 10:07:11'),
